      "story_intro": "长夜松手之后，泉水顺着地脉一路向南，涌进了夏天的海岸。沙洲上的守灵没有迎接来客，只留下一片倒卷上岸的晨雾和两条雾失方向的径。艾吉提着上两季赢来的灯走进雾里——夏之岸的第一句问候，得自己挣。",
      "story_intro_en": "After the long night let go, the spring ran south through the ley-lines and flooded into the summer shore. The sandbar warden sent no welcome — only sea fog rolling inland and two lanes losing their bearings. Eggy walked into the mist carrying lamps earned in the last two seasons; the shore's first greeting would have to be won.",
      "story_outro": "晨雾在正午前溃退，沙洲露出一枚巨大的螺号。守灵的声音从壳里传出来：沿着潮汐走，潮镜在下一个弯口等你们。",
      "story_outro_en": "The mist broke before noon and left one huge conch on the sand. The warden's voice came out of the shell: follow the tide — the mirror waits at the next bend."
