      "story_intro": "潮镜是一湾会自己回头的海：涨潮时两条长廓同时没水，退潮时塔阵又露出沙痕。海之守灵立下规矩——蛋要在两次回头之间不破，潮才肯为村庄让路。艾吉把阵脚扎在了潮线之上。",
      "story_intro_en": "Tideturn Hollow is a bay that walks back on itself: at flood both long galleries go under, at ebb the turret line resurfaces on the sand. The sea warden set the rule — the egg must survive between two turnings of the tide, and only then does the water yield the road. Eggy anchored the formation above the tideline.",
      "story_outro": "第二次回头之后，海真的让开了：一条发亮的沙路直抵蟹壳群岛。螺号在艾吉背上震了震——下一站，硬碰硬。",
      "story_outro_en": "After the second turning the sea genuinely parted: a shining sand-road ran straight to the Crabshell Isles. The conch on Eggy's back hummed once — next stop, shell against cannon."
    },
