      "story_intro": "蟹壳群岛的军团长不信潮镜的传言：村庄的塔不过是运气好。它把护盾队、抗术者与重甲排成叠进的方阵，从两条径同时碾过浅滩。螺号这一次没有劝架的意思——它在数节拍，等军团长学会弹簧舞。",
      "story_intro_en": "The legion commander of the Crabshell Isles scoffed at the tideturn rumours: the village towers were merely lucky. It filed shield ranks, resisters and heavy shells into a lockstep legion and ground ashore on both lanes at once. The conch had no mind to mediate this time — it kept the beat, waiting for the commander to learn the spring dance.",
      "story_outro": "军团长的钳子磕在塔阵上，像敲一面认输的锣。群岛让出航道，蟹壳成了村庄塔基最硬的填料。",
      "story_outro_en": "The commander's claw rang against the turrets like a gong of surrender. The isles yielded the channel, and crabshell became the hardest ballast beneath the village foundations."
    },
