      ],
      "story_intro": "夏天的雨说来就来：夏雷守灵把三径泡成雨幕，让飞兵贴着雨脚走，让重甲踩着雷点进。这是番外以来第一次，塔要在听不见炮声的雨里学会空地并守。艾吉把伞收了起来——雨里的村庄，不需要伞。",
      "story_intro_en": "Summer rain arrives the moment it is spoken of: the squall warden drowned the three roads in a curtain, runners hugging the hem of the rain, heavy shells stepping to the thunder. For the first time across all side stories, the towers must learn joint land-and-air defence in a storm that swallows every report. Eggy folded the umbrella — the village in the rain needs none.",
      "story_outro": "雨收在最后一声雷里。夏雷守灵把雷槌别在云上作别：再往岸的尽头去，烟花已经装填完毕。",
      "story_outro_en": "The rain packed itself into the last clap of thunder. The squall warden lodged its hammer in a cloud as a farewell: go on to the end of the shore — the fireworks are already loaded."
    },
