      ],
      "story_intro": "岸的尽头有一座不夜岬：夏之守灵倾三海之影——沙洲、潮镜与雷屿各遣一尊，分踏三径，赴一场烟花之礼。规矩很简单：若塔阵能让蛋在烟火下亮到天明，夏便许给村庄一半的海岸。这是季轮的盛夏之约，也是长夜之后，光明自己给自己出的考题。",
      "story_intro_en": "At the shore's end lies the Sleepless Cape: the summer warden summoned the shades of three seas — sandbar, tidemirror and thunderisle each sent one lord, treading three roads toward the fireworks rite. The terms were simple: if the turret line keeps the egg lit beneath the bursts until dawn, summer grants the village half its coast. The midsummer tryst of the season round — and, ever since the long night, light examining itself.",
      "story_outro": "天明时，半条海岸亮着未熄的余火，像村庄新长的灯链。夏答应了，蝉替它盖了章。而秋风的请柬，已经在浪沫里翻了个身。",
      "story_outro_en": "By dawn half the coast still glowed with unspent embers — a fresh chain of lamps the village had grown. Summer agreed; the cicadas stamped its seal. And in the sea foam, an invitation from the autumn wind had already turned over."
